        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RUWBI, Black Iron Bean Tip Tubular Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Black Iron Bean Tip Handleset is sure to make a statement with its rustic-looking craftsmanship. It is perfect for traditional spaces where a historical touch is desired. The bean tip lockset is made from cast iron with a matte black finish; and it is backed by a lifetime no-rust warranty. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Black Iron Bean Tip  Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Handleset Length: 9-5/8”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Handleset Width: 3-3/16”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Handleset Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Schlage-type C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Fits All Pre-drilled 2-1/8\" Crossbores, 15/16\" Edgebore</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</p>",
